{"seq":3,"slug":"device-trust","title":"设备信任与端点合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/implementation/device-trust","wordCount":1357,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"设备信任与端点合规\">设备信任与端点合规</h1><p>零信任的第三支柱是设备信任——仅验证&quot;谁在请求&quot;远远不够，还必须确认&quot;从什么设备发出&quot;。一个合法用户从已感染恶意软件的终端发起请求，其风险不亚于凭证被盗。设备信任评估（Device Trust Assessment）通过持续采集端点安全态势信号，将设备合规状态纳入每次访问决策的输入维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>设备态势（Device Posture）是一组描述终端安全状态的信号集合。策略引擎消费这些信号，与身份和行为信号共同决定访问权限：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号类别</th>\n<th>具体指标</th>\n<th>采集方式</th>\n<th>风险权重</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>操作系统</td>\n<td>OS 版本、补丁级别</td>\n<td>MDM/EDR Agent</td>\n<td>高——未打补丁是主要攻击面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘加密</td>\n<td>FileVault/BitLocker 状态</td>\n<td>MDM 合规检查</td>\n<td>高——丢失设备导致数据泄露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EDR 代理</td>\n<td>代理是否活跃、签名版本</td>\n<td>EDR 心跳 API</td>\n<td>高——无 EDR 等于盲区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>防火墙</td>\n<td>主机防火墙是否启用</td>\n<td>OS 配置采集</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屏幕锁定</td>\n<td>自动锁屏超时设置</td>\n<td>MDM Policy</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>越狱/Root</td>\n<td>设备完整性状态</td>\n<td>Attestation API</td>\n<td>极高——已越狱设备无安全保障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证书绑定</td>\n<td>设备证书是否有效且绑定</td>\n<td>PKI/SCEP</td>\n<td>高——证明设备身份</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"设备信任架构\">设备信任架构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 终端&#10;        AGENT[EDR/MDM Agent]&#10;        CERT[设备证书]&#10;        TPM[TPM/安全芯片]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 态势服务&#10;        MDM[MDM 平台 Intune/Jamf]&#10;        EDR[EDR 平台 CrowdStrike/SentinelOne]&#10;        ATTEST[设备证明服务]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 控制平面&#10;        CDM[持续诊断 CDM]&#10;        PE[策略引擎]&#10;    end&#10;    AGENT --&gt; MDM&#10;    AGENT --&gt; EDR&#10;    TPM --&gt; ATTEST&#10;    CERT --&gt; ATTEST&#10;    MDM --&gt; CDM&#10;    EDR --&gt; CDM&#10;    ATTEST --&gt; CDM&#10;    CDM --&gt; PE\">graph TD\n    subgraph 终端\n        AGENT[EDR/MDM Agent]\n        CERT[设备证书]\n        TPM[TPM/安全芯片]\n    end\n    subgraph 态势服务\n        MDM[MDM 平台 Intune/Jamf]\n        EDR[EDR 平台 CrowdStrike/SentinelOne]\n        ATTEST[设备证明服务]\n    end\n    subgraph 控制平面\n        CDM[持续诊断 CDM]\n        PE[策略引擎]\n    end\n    AGENT --&gt; MDM\n    AGENT --&gt; EDR\n    TPM --&gt; ATTEST\n    CERT --&gt; ATTEST\n    MDM --&gt; CDM\n    EDR --&gt; CDM\n    ATTEST --&gt; CDM\n    CDM --&gt; PE</pre><p><strong>设备证明（Device Attestation）</strong> 是设备信任的密码学基础。现代设备通过 TPM（可信平台模块）或 Secure Enclave 生成不可导出的私钥，证明请求确实来自特定的物理设备而非软件仿冒：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Apple 设备</strong>：DeviceCheck API + Managed Device Attestation</li>\n<li><strong>Windows 设备</strong>：TPM 2.0 + Windows Hello for Business</li>\n<li><strong>Android 设备</strong>：Android Key Attestation + Play Integrity API</li>\n<li><strong>ChromeOS</strong>：Verified Access API（BeyondCorp Enterprise 原生支持）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"合规评分模型\">合规评分模型</h2><p>将离散的态势信号转化为策略引擎可消费的统一评分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{device} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i \\cdot s_i \\cdot p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{device}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为设备合规分数（0-100），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个信号的状态值（0 或 1），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该信号的权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为时间衰减因子（信号越陈旧可信度越低）。</p>\n<p><strong>时间衰减</strong>的设计动机：设备状态不是静态的。一台设备 5 分钟前报告合规，不代表现在仍然合规——用户可能刚关闭了 EDR 代理。常见的衰减策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>EDR 心跳超过 15 分钟未更新 → 合规分数降级</li>\n<li>补丁状态超过 24 小时未检查 → 该维度分数归零</li>\n<li>设备证书将在 7 天内过期 → 触发续期提醒 + 降低可信度</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"byod-与非托管设备策略\">BYOD 与非托管设备策略</h2><p>零信任不意味着禁止非托管设备（BYOD）——而是用差异化策略管控风险：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设备类型</th>\n<th>可访问资源</th>\n<th>附加条件</th>\n<th>典型实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>企业托管 + 全合规</td>\n<td>所有授权资源</td>\n<td>标准 MFA</td>\n<td>直接访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>企业托管 + 部分合规</td>\n<td>中低敏感资源</td>\n<td>步进 MFA + 只读</td>\n<td>降级模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BYOD + 安装 Agent</td>\n<td>低敏感资源</td>\n<td>强 MFA + DLP</td>\n<td>ZTNA Broker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BYOD + 无 Agent</td>\n<td>仅 SaaS Web 应用</td>\n<td>强 MFA + 无下载 + 水印</td>\n<td>浏览器隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未知设备</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>浏览器隔离（Browser Isolation）</strong> 是处理非托管设备的关键技术：用户通过远程浏览器访问应用，数据仅以像素流传输到终端——即使设备被感染，攻击者也无法获取实际数据。Cloudflare Browser Isolation 和 Zscaler Cloud Browser 是当前的主流方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"设备生命周期管理\">设备生命周期管理</h2><p>设备信任不是一次性判断，而是贯穿设备在企业中的完整生命周期：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>入网注册</strong>：设备通过 MDM 注册，安装企业证书和 Agent，建立初始信任</li>\n<li><strong>持续合规</strong>：Agent 定期报告态势信号，CDM 持续计算合规分数</li>\n<li><strong>违规响应</strong>：合规分数低于阈值 → 自动降级访问权限 → 通知用户修复</li>\n<li><strong>隔离处置</strong>：检测到活跃威胁（如挖矿进程、C2 通信）→ 立即撤销所有会话、隔离网络</li>\n<li><strong>退网回收</strong>：员工离职 → 远程擦除企业数据、撤销证书、从 MDM 注销</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"iot-设备的特殊挑战\">IoT 设备的特殊挑战</h2><p>IoT 设备（摄像头、传感器、打印机等）无法安装 Agent，也不支持 MFA。零信任对 IoT 的处理策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>网络隔离</strong>：IoT 设备放入独立的 VLAN/VPC，通过网关代理访问企业资源</li>\n<li><strong>流量基线</strong>：建立设备正常通信模式（如摄像头只与 NVR 通信），偏差即告警</li>\n<li><strong>最小连接</strong>：IoT 设备只被允许访问其功能所必需的最少服务端点</li>\n<li><strong>固件验证</strong>：通过签名校验确保固件未被篡改</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>设备信任是零信任第三支柱——合法用户 + 感染设备 = 高风险</li>\n<li>设备证明（TPM/Attestation）提供不可伪造的设备身份证明</li>\n<li>合规评分模型将多维态势信号聚合为策略引擎可消费的统一分数</li>\n<li>BYOD 差异化策略平衡安全与灵活性，浏览器隔离保护非托管设备场景</li>\n<li>IoT 设备通过网络隔离 + 流量基线 + 最小连接实现有限度的零信任覆盖</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"microsegmentation\">微隔离与东西向流量治理</a>——设备合规评估后，如何在网络层限制设备可达范围</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../service-mesh/foundations/service-mesh-concepts\">服务网格概念与架构</a>——Service Mesh 如何为服务间通信提供身份验证与流量控制的基础设施</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"设备信任与端点合规","id":"设备信任与端点合规"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"设备信任架构","id":"设备信任架构"},{"level":2,"text":"合规评分模型","id":"合规评分模型"},{"level":2,"text":"BYOD 与非托管设备策略","id":"byod-与非托管设备策略"},{"level":2,"text":"设备生命周期管理","id":"设备生命周期管理"},{"level":2,"text":"IoT 设备的特殊挑战","id":"iot-设备的特殊挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"微隔离与东西向流量治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/implementation/microsegmentation"},"next":{"title":"ZTNA 与软件定义边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/data-plane/ztna-sdp"}}